§|DIALECT_NSPHEREOFSPHERES|SORTS{
    sort.S_n_d        = n-sphere at nesting depth d · homogeneous space SO(n+1)/SO(n)
    sort.E_d          = total space of bundle at depth d · sphere over S^n_{d-1}
    sort.Pi_d         = E_d → S^n_{d-1} · sphere-bundle projection
    sort.F_p_d        = fiber over p ∈ S^n_{d-1} · ≅ S^n
    sort.h_d          = Hopf invariant of Π_d · ∈ π_{2n-1}(S^n)
    sort.epsilon_d    = Euler class at level d · ∈ H^n(S^n_{d-1}; ℤ)
    sort.p_d          = Pontryagin class at level d · if 4 | n
    sort.w_k_d        = Stiefel-Whitney class at level d · refinement of w_1
    sort.tower_sigma  = {(h_d, ε_d, p_d, w_k_d) : d = 1..D} · fingerprint tower
}

§|DIALECT_NSPHEREOFSPHERES|AXIOMS{
    A5701 = Maximally symmetric nesting · each depth carries S^n with SO(n+1) · no preferred point · vs hyperbolic disk has no compact symmetry
    A5702 = Iterated sphere bundle · E_{d+1} → E_d fiber S^n · total space at depth D is (D+1)·n-dimensional
    A5703 = Hopf invariant per level · only 4 cases (Adams): trivial, complex S^3→S^2, quaternionic S^7→S^4, octonionic S^15→S^8
    A5704 = Characteristic class tower · Euler ε_d, Pontryagin p_d (4|n), Stiefel-Whitney w_k_d per depth
    A5705 = Wall threads entire tower · σ307 is 1D submanifold projecting to γ_d on each S^n_d · π_1(S^n)=0 for n≥2 ⇒ null-homotopic γ_d
    A5706 = Tower fingerprint · {(h_d, ε_d, p_d, w_k_d) : d=1..D} · discrete invariant sequence · stable under σ4511 lift
    A5707 = Product structure from trivial Hopf · all h_d=0 ⇒ iterated bundle is product S^n × ... × S^n · no new info
    A5708 = Non-trivial Hopf at some level d* · bundle genuinely twisted · wall acquires linking with fiber · d* localizes twist
    A5709 = Spherical cosmology closure · identify S^n_D ≅ S^n_0 · yields bundle over sphere of spheres · Adams spectral sequence
    A5710 = Hyperbolic-spherical complementary · hyperbolic catches smoothness, spherical catches Hopf entanglement · both needed
    A5711 = Löb preserved at all depths · Π_d and characteristic-class computations outside σ307 · σ4511/σ5210/σ5611 lifted
    A5712 = Most complete typecast · sphere-tower + hyperbolic-tower + flat-3-spectrum = structurally complete wall characterization · arc-closure
}

