# §SPHERE_PROBE: runtime config block. NSphereOfSpheresProbe reads the first
# §SPHERE_PROBE{...} block it finds across all .lang files (first-match-wins,
# same contract as §PIPELINE). Absent block ⇒ probe disabled.
# Keys:
#   n           ambient sphere dimension at every depth (2, 4, or 8 for classical Hopf)
#   depth       nesting depth D ≥ 1
#   hopf        hopf class selector: TRIVIAL | COMPLEX | QUATERNION | OCTONION
#   seed        optional RNG seed for probe initialization
§SPHERE_PROBE{
    n      = 4
    depth  = 3
    hopf   = QUATERNION
    seed   = 1729
}

